2. 言語名にちなんだJSONファイルを作成します（例：`python.json`）。
```json
{
"language": "python",
"snippets": [
{
"id": "my_list_comp",
"title": "リスト内包表記",
"difficulty": 3,
"topics": ["リスト", "内包表記"],
"code": "squares = [x**2 for x in range(10)]\n"
},
{
"id": "my_dict_comp",
"title": "辞書内包表記",
"difficulty": 4,
"topics": ["辞書", "内包表記"],
"code": "counts = {word: len(word) for word in words}\n"
}
]
}
```

